# Build output of `npm run build:engine` and `npm run build:cube-engine`. Regenerable in
# one command each, so neither is committed here - the COMMITTED copies are the Swift
# package resources at
#   ios/Packages/MQEngineJS/Sources/MQEngineJS/Resources/engine.bundle.js
#   ios/Packages/MQCubeEngineJS/Sources/MQCubeEngineJS/Resources/cube-engine.bundle.js
# which SwiftPM and Xcode need on disk without running Node. `npm run check:engine` and
# `npm run check:cube-engine` prove those copies are not stale by hashing their OWN BYTES
# against a fresh build; `npm test` and `ios/test.command` run both checks.
dist/

# SwiftPM
ios/.build/
ios/.swiftpm/
.DS_Store
